{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640080","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"narration:0:1064008001:0":{"text":"苦労した結果、ついに濃厚な元素エキスを手に入れた。","source_cn":"经历了费时的寻找，你们成功收集到了浓郁的元素精华。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3105C1B6B99C96E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1064008002:0":{"text":"鉱洞に戻ると、ゾーヤがそこであなたたちを待っていた。彼女の前には、灰色の泡をぷくぷくと立てる大きな鉄鍋が置かれている。","source_cn":"随后，你们返回了矿洞里，祖娅已经在此等候。而她的面前正...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064008003:1":{"text":"おっ、ナイスタイミング！","source_cn":"你们回来的正好！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x88D9A03E29CF4F06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064008004:1":{"text":"さあ、カサタケ結晶ポタージュを召し上がれ！","source_cn":"快来尝尝晶化伞菇浓汤！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x642F324E80BCC747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:4::2":{"text":"カサタケ結晶ポタージュ","source_cn":"晶化伞菇浓汤","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47B130493054B7F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1064008004":{"text":"さあ、カサタケ結晶ポタージュを召し上がれ！","source_cn":"快来尝尝晶化伞菇浓汤！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x642F324E80BCC747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064008005:1":{"text":"当然だろ！使ったのはエンバー結晶とトビキノコの頭の傘、それから小麦粉に山羊ミルクだけだ。","source_cn":"肯定能啊！原料是暗烬晶体、蹦蹦菇灵头上的小伞菌、面粉和羊奶。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xCCC9867F3C4BD0B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064008006:1":{"text":"どれも普通に食えるもんだろ？","source_cn":"多正常啊！都是能吃的东西！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x99198ECA458F3202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064008007:1":{"text":"小麦粉と山羊ミルク以外の二つも「普通」なのか……？","source_cn":"面粉和羊奶以外的另两个也算普通吗……？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5D45B6C4CF56CBC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064008008:1":{"text":"判断基準が「食べられる」だけというのもね……","source_cn":"判断标准竟然是能不能吃吗……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5954F047B5E17A62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064008009:1":{"text":"そうだな、キノコ類は特に用心する必要がある。","source_cn":"老夫也这么觉得，菌菇类食用起来需要格外小心。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x2F3E1F1F7099B3F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064008010:0":{"text":"この傘の色合いを見るに……やや不安だな。","source_cn":"这个菌伞的颜色看起来……不太妙啊。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB2F4DA770F35EF90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064008011:0":{"text":"あ、気付いた？レシピにはシゲカサタケってあったんだけど、ちょっと閃いてさ――","source_cn":"竟然被发现了……食谱上写的是茸茸伞菇，但我灵机一动——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBB1922501ED51166","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064008012:0":{"text":"トビキノコの頭の傘で代用できないかと思ったんだよ。同じキノコだし、あんま変わんないだろ……？","source_cn":"换成了蹦蹦菇灵头上的小伞菌。反正、反正都是蘑菇，差不多...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1064008012":{"text":"トビキノコの頭の傘で代用できないかと思ったんだよ。同じキノコだし、あんま変わんないだろ……？","source_cn":"换成了蹦蹦菇灵头上的小伞菌。反正、反正都是蘑菇，差不多的吧……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3BFF5848CC191C56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064008013:1":{"text":"まあまあ、冒険なくして発見は得られないって言ったろ？","source_cn":"不不不，都说了冒险才有惊喜。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xA602E816A3DDFACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064008014:0":{"text":"トビキノコは、キノコの魔物なのか？","source_cn":"蹦蹦菇灵是蘑菇怪吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x11FC265A2F886DD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064008015:1":{"text":"歩き茸みたいなものかな？","source_cn":"听起来有点像行走菇呢。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x69C98F1FE782CE92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064008016:1":{"text":"そうは見えないけど……","source_cn":"我不这么觉得……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x91058339E850AF75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064008017:1":{"text":"ゾーヤさん、ぜひ俺にも飲ませてくれ。","source_cn":"祖娅，请给我盛一碗。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x313FE032FDB5274D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064008018:1":{"text":"俺もあなたと同じ考えだ。人は常に探求心を持つべきだよな！","source_cn":"我非常认同你的观点，冒险精神是必不可少的东西！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x10F7176D509DF699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064008019:1":{"text":"い、いや、そこまで大層なもんじゃないけど……","source_cn":"倒、倒也不必这么坚定……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x56D5D195CB872178","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064008020:1":{"text":"まあでも、飲んでくれるのは嬉しいよ。","source_cn":"但、但还是谢谢你赏脸……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE4F7F2F644EFD8F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064008021:1":{"text":"皆の疑念をよそに、ライオスはゾーヤからボウルを受け取ると、一気にポタージュを半分以上飲み干した。","source_cn":"莱欧斯不顾你们的质疑，接过祖娅递来的碗，一口气喝下了大...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064008022:1":{"text":"あなたたちは息を呑みながら、彼の反応を見守る。","source_cn":"你们在一旁屏住呼吸，紧张地观察着他的反应。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD81DC5ECE764E33F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064008023:0":{"text":"うーん……独特な、ミネラルの味がする。舌触りは滑らかだ。","source_cn":"唔……有种奇特的矿物质味道，质地很顺滑。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCF7FC2B3EE3D6144","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064008024:0":{"text":"あとはキノコの香りも……トビキノコが、目の前をピョンピョン跳ねるのが見えるような……","source_cn":"又有菌菇的香气，好像能看到蹦蹦菇灵在我面前跳动……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x611D9A61DE9FB423","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064008025:1":{"text":"おい、幻覚が見えてるんじゃないだろうな？","source_cn":"喂！你该不会产生幻觉了吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x47C8952B45CC6962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064008026:0":{"text":"ライオス、大丈夫？","source_cn":"莱欧斯？你没事吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x89518F329482AA61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064008027:1":{"text":"あ、トビキノコがあっちに行こうって――うぉええええ……","source_cn":"啊，蹦蹦菇灵说要往那边去——呕呕呕呕呕……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7404315DD9D8BAB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064008028:0":{"text":"ふらふらとその場を離れたと思うと、ライオスは鉱石の柱にもたれかかり、盛大に吐いた。","source_cn":"莱欧斯跌跌撞撞地跑向了远处，扶着矿柱狂吐了起来。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1D5577FF2850DED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064008029:0":{"text":"洞窟にその音が反響し、全員が気まずい顔になる……","source_cn":"回声在矿洞中反复回荡，场面更尴尬了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCB860B98136E5CEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064008030:1":{"text":"えっと……実験、失敗だな……","source_cn":"呃……看来，实验失败了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF133BB8626273C4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064008031:1":{"text":"ほんっとにごめん！最初に自分で味見するべきだった！","source_cn":"对不起！我太草率了！我应该先自己品尝的！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x39E2965233992003","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064008032:1":{"text":"え？味見しなかったんですか！？","source_cn":"祖娅，你自己竟然都没尝过！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9C01D9C96DEC1017","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064008033:1":{"text":"大丈夫だろうと思って……ごめん！お詫びに、この高炉ターキーロールをやるから！","source_cn":"我得意忘形了……作为赔罪，我请大家吃这个锻炉火鸡卷！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x156927987A93413E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:52::2":{"text":"高炉ターキーロール","source_cn":"锻炉火鸡卷","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x918767B17DA9C193","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064008034:1":{"text":"これも、あなたが作ったの？","source_cn":"这不会也是你做的吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC64ADCD840A194A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064008035:0":{"text":"安心しな、村のグウェンナが作った安全なターキーロールだ！","source_cn":"放心，这是村里葛文娜大娘做的，安全无毒！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x69F06E695A0CA4E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064008036:1":{"text":"……オレが先に食べるよ！","source_cn":"……我先吃一口！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x27E183B89150B922","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064008037:1":{"text":"ほら！大丈夫だろ？","source_cn":"瞧！完全没问题！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC40BA11154AA0116","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064008038:1":{"text":"ライオスの嘔吐音が響く洞窟の中、あなたたちは何とも言えない表情でターキーロールを分け合った――","source_cn":"你们在莱欧斯的呕吐伴奏声中，面色复杂地分食了锻炉火鸡卷。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC07C256906E94491","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1064008039:0":{"text":"確かに美味しかったが、「環境音」のせいで食欲も半減してしまった。","source_cn":"味道确实不错，只是背景音乐让人胃口大减。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x46509D9E63E8A11E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064008040:1":{"text":"すると、思ったよりも早くライオスが戻ってきた……","source_cn":"令人意外的是，莱欧斯很快回来了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3DA89EF0B4932C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064008041:1":{"text":"もう大丈夫だ！少し具合が悪くなったが、今はむしろいい気分だよ！","source_cn":"我没事了！虽然刚才有点不舒服，但现在感觉特别好！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC1F137421D17B1DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064008042:1":{"text":"早速、暗黒召喚鍋を作ろう！もう待ちきれないんだ！","source_cn":"我们快去做最后的黑暗召唤锅吧，我已经等不及了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x655C9092C6B2813B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064008043:1":{"text":"本当？もう少し休まなくて平気？","source_cn":"你确定吗？要不要再休息一下？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF8DBF9369912E1FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064008044:1":{"text":"問題ない！ファリンが待ってるんだ、早く行こう！","source_cn":"不用不用，法琳还在等我们！快走吧！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x38DF8F6F1087B4D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:71:1064008044":{"text":"問題ない！ファリンが待ってるんだ、早く行こう！","source_cn":"不用不用，法琳还在等我们！快走吧！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x38DF8F6F1087B4D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:73:1064008045:1":{"text":"……これもポタージュの副作用じゃないだろうな。","source_cn":"……搞不好是浓汤的副作用。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xAC6E754928D29BAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:74:1064008046:1":{"text":"……可能性はある。","source_cn":"……很有道理。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x6923B88EFC8CC41C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:75:1064008047:1":{"text":"ライオスに催促され、申し訳なさそうなゾーヤに別れを告げたあなたたちは、最後の旅へ出発した。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:76:1064008048:1":{"text":"四つの食材は揃った。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_reco